The build config rootDir and the package manifest exports and bin must agree on the emitted layout: a rootDir of src puts artifacts at dist/*.js rather than dist/src/*.js, which is exactly where the declared entry points resolve. Nothing else compares the two files, so a moved rootDir or a relocated emit path ships a package whose declared entries do not exist.
